<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/icon/logo-fav-icon.svg">
    <title>Mot de passe réinitialisé — SailingLoc</title>
    <style>
        * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: #f0f4f8;
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: 24px;
        }
        .brand {
            color: #0a4d8c;
            font-size: 15px;
            font-weight: 600;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 6px;
        }
        .card {
            background: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 20px;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.25);
            max-width: 500px;
            width: 100%;
            padding: 48px 40px 36px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .badge {
            width: 80px;
            height: 80px;
            background: #fbbf24;
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            margin: 0 auto 28px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(251,191,36,0.4);
        }
        .badge svg { width: 32px; height: 40px; }
        h1 { color: #111827; font-size: 26px; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 10px; }
        .subtitle { color: #6b7280; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 28px; }
        .info-card {
            background: #f8fafc;
            border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 20px 24px;
            margin-bottom: 28px;
            text-align: left;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #374151;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        .btn {
            display: inline-block;
            background: #0a4d8c;
            color: #ffffff;
            text-decoration: none;
            padding: 14px 40px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-size: 15px;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 0.2px;
            transition: background 0.2s;
        }
        .btn:hover { background: #083d72; }
        .footer {
            margin-top: 28px;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #9ca3af;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 6px;
        }
        .footer-dot { width: 8px; height: 8px; background: #4ade80; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="brand"><svg width="14" height="18" viewBox="0 0 48 60" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M24 57C13 44 6 33 6 21.5 6 11 14.1 3 24 3s18 8 18 18.5C42 33 35 44 24 57Z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="4" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round"></path><path d="M24 14 34 34H14Z" fill="currentColor"></path><path d="M10 34Q24 30 38 34Q24 42 10 34Z" fill="currentColor"></path><path d="M8 47q8-5 16 0t16 0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round"></path></svg>SailingLoc</div>
    <div class="card">
        <div class="badge">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 48 60" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M24 57C13 44 6 33 6 21.5 6 11 14.1 3 24 3s18 8 18 18.5C42 33 35 44 24 57Z" fill="none" stroke="#1a3a5c" stroke-width="4" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round"></path><path d="M24 14 34 34H14Z" fill="#1a3a5c"></path><path d="M10 34Q24 30 38 34Q24 42 10 34Z" fill="#1a3a5c"></path><path d="M8 47q8-5 16 0t16 0" fill="none" stroke="#1a3a5c" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round"></path></svg>
        </div>
        <h1>Mot de passe mis à jour !</h1>
        <p class="subtitle">Votre mot de passe a bien été réinitialisé.<br>Vous pouvez maintenant vous connecter avec votre nouveau mot de passe.</p>
        <div class="info-card">
            🔒 Pour la sécurité de votre compte, ce lien de réinitialisation n'est plus utilisable.
        </div>
        <a href="{{ loginUrl }}" class="btn">Se connecter</a>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
        <span class="footer-dot"></span>
        Mot de passe réinitialisé avec succès &mdash; &copy; {{ "now"|date("Y") }} SailingLoc
    </div>
</body>
</html>
